Since this thread is about #twoweapon, there are both weapons
to be considered.  The best of both worlds can be picked - a
silver saber and a katana.  Even better, either can be substituted
with an artifact weapon of the same type.

Greyswandir and a katana both highly enchanted work great.
Frost/Fire Brand and a silver saber both highly enchanted
work great.  A lesser long sword artifact like Excalibur or
Demonbane or Sunsword and a silver saber work great.  Even
Werebane and a katana is fine.

So what to twoweapon?  IMO your best artifact and either a
silver saber or a highly enchanted long sword class either
katana or long sword.



